@Gestao_FDC_HostAddress = http://localhost:5286
@token = COLE_SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

### Login
POST {{Gestao_FDC_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Listar categorias
GET {{Gestao_FDC_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Listar produtos
GET {{Gestao_FDC_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Criar cliente
POST {{Gestao_FDC_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Silva",
  "phone": "81999999999",
  "address": "Rua das Flores, 120",
  "email": "maria@email.com"
}

### Criar pedido delivery
POST {{Gestao_FDC_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderType": 3,
  "customerId": 1,
  "notes": "Entregar sem atraso",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 2,
      "notes": "Bem quente"
    },
    {
      "productId": 3,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Atualizar status do pedido
PATCH {{Gestao_FDC_HostAddress}}/api/orders/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 4
}

### Listar transacoes financeiras
GET {{Gestao_FDC_HostAddress}}/api/financial/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Criar despesa
POST {{Gestao_FDC_HostAddress}}/api/financial/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 125.90,
  "type": 2,
  "description": "Compra de insumos",
  "category": "Insumos"
}

### Resumo financeiro
GET {{Gestao_FDC_HostAddress}}/api/financial/summary?start=2026-04-01&end=2026-04-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
